  "about_app": "The 'Aqim' app is a simple and direct Islamic application, designed specifically to help you perform your prayers on time with ease.\nThe app focuses on providing the essential tools that every Muslim needs in their daily life, through an easy-to-use interactive interface that ensures a comfortable and clear experience.\nWith 'Aqim', you will never miss a prayer again, as the app works as a personal alarm and precise guide for your Qibla, making it the perfect tool for maintaining the most important pillars of Islam.",
  "@about_app": {
    "type": "text",
    "placeholders": {}
  },
  "about_app2": "App Features:",
  "@about_app2": {
    "type": "text",
    "placeholders": {}
  },
  "about_app3": "Prayer Times: The app displays prayer times with high accuracy based on your geographical location.\nAdhan Notifications: Receive audio alerts when each prayer time arrives to always be ready.\nQibla Direction: An accurate and easy-to-use compass to determine the correct Qibla direction from anywhere in the world.\nInteractive Interface: Simple and clear design that makes it easy to navigate between app features without any complexity.",
  "@about_app3": {
    "type": "text",
    "placeholders": {}
  },
